            "draft_status": "published",
            "enable_logs_sample": null,
            "enable_samples": null,
            "escalation_message": "",
            "evaluation_delay": 0,
            "force_delete": null,
            "group_retention_duration": "",
            "groupby_simple_monitor": null,
            "id": "314372622",
            "include_tags": true,
            "locked": false,
            "message": "{{#is_alert}}\n## P3 · Deployment-Induced Customer Impact — CONFIRMED\n**WHAT:** The single highest-precision page in the framework: an error-rate regression AND a latency regression in the same service within the post-deploy window. Almost never a false positive, and the remediation is known before a human reads the alert (roll back).\n**WHY THIS IS DIFFERENT:** every member condition below is true at the same time, which is what separates a real incident from an isolated symptom:\n  - Deployment Regression\n  - API p99 Latency Degradation\n**WHERE:** {{value}} · env `stage`\n**SERVICE / SCOPE:** `application-platform` (application)\n**BUSINESS IMPACT:** Confirmed impact: every member condition is true simultaneously, which is the evidence threshold this platform requires before paging on a symptom.\n**OWNER:** application-development (observers: sre) · does not page\n**DO THIS NEXT:** Treat as a confirmed incident. The member alerts are the evidence trail; the runbook's remediation section applies directly.\n**RUNBOOK:** attached to this monitor as `Deployment Regression` — open it from the monitor's Runbook asset.\n**AUTOMATED DIAGNOSTICS:** workflow `auto-enrich-change`.\n**SLO / ERROR BUDGET:** `slo-app-availability`\n{{/is_alert}}\n{{#is_recovery}}\n## Recovered · Deployment-Induced Customer Impact\nAt least one member condition cleared, so the confirmed-impact state no longer holds. Individual member monitors may still be alerting — check before closing the incident.\n{{/is_recovery}}",
            "monitor_threshold_windows": [],
            "monitor_thresholds": [],
            "name": "[P3][stage][application] Deployment-Induced Customer Impact (composite)",
            "new_group_delay": 0,
            "new_host_delay": 300,
            "no_data_timeframe": 0,
            "notification_preset_name": "",
            "notify_audit": false,
            "notify_by": [],
