            "id": "314985802",
            "include_tags": true,
            "locked": false,
            "message": "{{#is_alert}}\n## P3 · API Management Backend Latency Degradation\n**WHAT:** Deliberately paired with apim-gateway-latency-degradation. Gateway slow and backend flat is a policy or capacity problem inside APIM; both slow together is the backend, and the investigation moves to the service.\n\n**WHERE:** {{value}} · env `stage` · region `global`\n**SERVICE:** `api-services` (cloud / azure_apim, tier0)\n**BUSINESS IMPACT:** The service still functions but measurably worse; a subset of traffic or users is failing.\n**WHY IT TRIGGERED:** The signal changed faster than the configured percentage relative to its own recent history. Speed of degradation, not absolute level.\n**OWNER:** cloud-engineering · support 24x7 · this does not page\n**RUNBOOK:** attached to this monitor as `API Management Backend Latency Degradation` — open it from the monitor's Runbook asset.\n**AUTOMATED DIAGNOSTICS:** workflow `diag-dependency` has run; its output is attached to this event.\n**RELATED EVENTS:** correlated on `edge.stage.api-services` — deployments, infrastructure changes and platform events from the last 30 minutes are attached as context.\n**SLO / ERROR BUDGET:** `slo-api-latency` · no error-budget impact (non-production)\n{{/is_alert}}\n{{#is_warning}}\n## API Management Backend Latency Degradation — warning\nApproaching the alert condition on {{value}}. Investigate before it becomes P3.\n{{/is_warning}}\n{{#is_no_data}}\n## API Management Backend Latency Degradation — NO DATA\nTelemetry stopped arriving for {{value}}. Treat this as a telemetry-health incident: an unmonitored resource is worse than an alerting one.\n{{/is_no_data}}\n{{#is_recovery}}\n## Recovered · API Management Backend Latency Degradation\n{{value}} returned to normal. Error-budget impact recorded against `slo-api-latency`. No action required; the correlation group closes when every child recovers.\n{{/is_recovery}}\n{{#is_warning_recovery}}\nWarning cleared for {{value}}.\n{{/is_warning_recovery}}",
