            "message": "{{#is_alert}}\n## P3 · Service Bus Oldest Message Age\n**WHAT:** Service Bus Oldest Message Age: freshness signal detected by threshold analysis.\n**WHERE:** {{value}} · env `stage` · region `global`\n**SERVICE:** `messaging-platform` (messaging / queue, tier0)\n**BUSINESS IMPACT:** The service still functions but measurably worse; a subset of traffic or users is failing.\n**WHY IT TRIGGERED:** 15 minutes is the delivery commitment in slo-messaging-delivery. Age is the only backlog measure that means the same thing on a queue that handles ten messages a day and one that handles ten thousand a minute.\n\n**OWNER:** cloud-engineering · support 24x7 · this does not page\n**RUNBOOK:** attached to this monitor as `Service Bus Oldest Message Age` — open it from the monitor's Runbook asset.\n**AUTOMATED DIAGNOSTICS:** workflow `diag-messaging` has run; its output is attached to this event.\n**RELATED EVENTS:** correlated on `messaging.stage.messaging-platform` — deployments, infrastructure changes and platform events from the last 30 minutes are attached as context.\n**SLO / ERROR BUDGET:** `slo-messaging-delivery` · no error-budget impact (non-production)\n{{/is_alert}}\n{{#is_warning}}\n## Service Bus Oldest Message Age — warning\nApproaching the alert condition on {{value}}. Investigate before it becomes P3.\n{{/is_warning}}\n{{#is_no_data}}\n## Service Bus Oldest Message Age — NO DATA\nTelemetry stopped arriving for {{value}}. Treat this as a telemetry-health incident: an unmonitored resource is worse than an alerting one.\n{{/is_no_data}}\n{{#is_recovery}}\n## Recovered · Service Bus Oldest Message Age\n{{value}} returned to normal. Error-budget impact recorded against `slo-messaging-delivery`. No action required; the correlation group closes when every child recovers.\n{{/is_recovery}}\n{{#is_warning_recovery}}\nWarning cleared for {{value}}.\n{{/is_warning_recovery}}",
            "monitor_threshold_windows": [],
            "monitor_thresholds": [
              {
                "critical": "900",
                "critical_recovery": "",
                "ok": "",
                "unknown": "",
                "warning": "300",
                "warning_recovery": ""
              }
            ],
